    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "The framework CoGS is based on the discovery of a semi-ring algebraic structure over the weight space of 2-layer neural networks, with specifically defined addition and multiplication operations. The loss function is a function of sum potentials, which are ring homomorphisms, allowing for the composition of partial solutions into global ones.",
