    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The paper demonstrates that around 95% of the solutions obtained by gradient descent match exactly with the theoretical constructions of order-4 and order-6 solutions. The experiments also show that the training dynamics favor low-order global solutions, and that overparameterization asymptotically decouples the training dynamics.",
